  <item>
    <title>波音747为什么退役了，C919能带来什么？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68e91b9d525f51df38aa0429</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68e91b9d525f51df38aa0429</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 12 Oct 2025 08:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>从747到C919：中国航司如何在这场航空革命中弯道超车？</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天我们将深度解读这场航空业的世纪变革。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从波音747探讨技术革新如何重塑天空，聚焦中国航司在这场变革中的智慧抉择。</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 陶喆-一点点</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. 银河快递-蒲公英</span></p><span></span><p><span>3. Thomas Rhett - Up</span></p><span></span><p><span>4. 王力宏-爱错</span></p><span></span><p><span>5. 蔡健雅-达尔文</span></p><span></span><p><span>6. 单依纯-有趣</span></p><span></span><p><span>7. 孙燕姿-日落</span></p><span></span><p><span>8. 五月天-步步</span></p>]]></description>
